"Add a Checklists column to the Posts screen showing how many requirements "
"are complete."
msgstr ""
"Dette tilføjer en tjeklistekolonne til oversigten over indlæg, som viser "
"hvor mange krav der er opfyldt."

msgid ""
"This allows tasks to be disabled for posts with specific taxonomy terms. Go "
"to the \"Post Types\" tab to choose the terms."
msgstr ""
"Dette gør det muligt at deaktivere opgaver for indlæg med specifikke "
"taksonomitermen. Gå til fanen \"Posttyper\" for at vælge termerne."

msgid ""
"This will display a warning icon in the \"Checklists\" box if requirements "
"are incomplete."
msgstr ""
"Dette vil vise et advarselssymbol i boksen \"Tjeklister\", hvis kravene ikke "
"er opfyldt."

msgid ""
"This will highlight Gutenberg blocks that fail block-specific checklist "
"tasks."
msgstr ""
"Dette vil fremhæve Gutenberg-blokke, der fejler i blokspecifikke "
"checklistopgaver."

msgid ""
"When enabled, all PublishPress Checklists data will be deleted if the plugin "
"is uninstalled."
msgstr ""
"Når dette er aktiveret vil alle data fra PublishPress Checklists blive "
"slettet, hvis pluginet afinstalleres."

msgid "This will show \"Exclude User Roles\" options."
msgstr "Dette vil vise \"Udeluk brugerroller\" muligheder."

msgid ""
"Disabling the \"Status\" option is recommended because it can be used to "
"avoid using the Checklists requirements."
msgstr ""
"Det er anbefalet at deaktivere \"Status\"-indstillingen, da denne kan bruges "
"til at omgå tjeklistekravene."

msgid ""
"This will disable \"Quick Edit\" for all users except those with the "
"\"manage_options\" capability."
msgstr ""
"Dette deaktiverer lynredigering for alle brugere, med mindre de har "
"\"manage_options\"-rettigheden."

msgid ""
"This will disable the \"Publish\" button when checklist requirements are not "
"met."
msgstr ""
"Dette vil deaktivere \"Udgiv\"-knappen når kravene i tjeklisten ikke er "
"opfyldt."

msgid "Enter your API Key to use OpenAI prompts in checklist tasks."
msgstr ""
"Indtast din API-nøgle for at bruger OpenAI-instrukser i tjeklisteoopgaver."

